## 🏗️ Project Structure

```text
├── data/                  # Cached prompts, raw inputs, and processed text
├── config/                # YAML configuration files for models and parameters
├── src/                   # Main modular codebase
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── llm_client.py      # LLM APIs and client connection setups
│   ├── vector_store.py    # Vector database initialization and indexing
│   └── main.py            # Primary application execution logic
├── app.py                 # Streamlit / Gradio web application UI
├── .env.example           # Example environment variables template
├── requirements.txt       # Project Python dependencies
└── README.md              # Project documentation
```

